{"id": "68365", "title": "师叔个个很狂野", "author": "皇焱儿", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 51, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68365.htm", "intro": "大河向东流哇\r\n美男师叔排成行哇\r\n说来咱就来哇\r\n你来我来一起来哇。\r\n(嘿咻嘿咻很狂野哇)\r\n（师叔个个很狂野哇)\r\n嘿呀~依儿呀~诶嘿诶嘿依儿呀~\r\n南迎风，荡剑门最低等的下剑门（下贱）废材女弟子，只不过想要御剑飞行而已，谁知，竟御来了师叔无数。\r\n师叔个个精力旺盛，\r\n师叔个个狂野暴躁，\r\n师叔个个很猛很强大。", "base": "files/article/html/68/68365", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10526215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10526216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10526217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10526218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10526219.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10526220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10526221.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10526222.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10526223.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10526224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-52", "file": "10526225.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1", "file": "10526226.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10526227.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10526228.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10526229.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10526230.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "10526231.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "10526232.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "10526233.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "10526234.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "10526235.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "10526236.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "10526237.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13", "file": "10526238.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14", "file": "10526239.html", "available": false}, {"title